{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"137","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. History"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polycarpus likes studying at school a lot and he is always diligent about his homework. Polycarpus has never had any problems with natural sciences as his great-great-grandfather was the great physicist Seinstein. On the other hand though, Polycarpus has never had an easy time with history."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Everybody knows that the World history encompasses exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" events: the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th event had continued from the year "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" to the year "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" inclusive ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai < bi"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Polycarpus easily learned the dates when each of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" events started and ended (Polycarpus inherited excellent memory from his great-great-granddad). But the teacher gave him a more complicated task: Polycaprus should know when all events began and ended and he should also find out for each event whether it includes another event. Polycarpus' teacher thinks that an event "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":" includes an event "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj < ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi < bj"},{"kind":"text","text":". Your task is simpler: find the number of events that are included in some other event."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first input line contains integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":") which represents the number of events. Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain descriptions of the historical events, one event per line. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai < bi ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the beginning and the end of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th event. No two events start or finish in the same year, that is, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai ≠ aj, ai ≠ bj, bi ≠ aj, bi ≠ bj"},{"kind":"text","text":" for all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":" (where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i ≠ j"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Events are given in arbitrary order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the only integer — the answer to the problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n1 10\n2 9\n3 8\n4 7\n5 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n1 100\n2 50\n51 99\n52 98\n10 60\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n1 1000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example the fifth event is contained in the fourth. Similarly, the fourth event is contained in the third, the third — in the second and the second — in the first."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example all events except the first one are contained in the first."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example only one event, so the answer is 0."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"137C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/137/problem/C"}